# Email Demo — inbox list where the red button "deletes" the top email (all rows spring
# up one slot, the new top row gets a springing blue highlight + shadow) and the green
# button restores it; pressing past either end shakes the button.
# What this test covers: deleting one at a time, rapid deletes through all 10
# emails and past the end (delete-button shake, repeated so the shake is
# cancelled and restarted), restoring one at a time and rapidly past zero
# (restore-button shake), interleaved delete/restore so the per-row springs
# (translateY, opacity, backgroundColor color spring, shadow springs) reverse
# mid-flight, and scrolling the FlatList while rows are shifted.
# Buttons are icon-only: restore (150,798), delete (252,798).
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/email-demo"
wait "text" "Welcome to our community" 10000
wait 1000
press 252 798
wait 700
press 252 798
wait 700
press 150 798
wait 700
# Rapid deletes through the whole list and past the end.
press 252 798 --count 12
wait 1500
press 252 798
wait 200
press 252 798
wait 1200
# Restore one at a time, then rapidly past zero.
press 150 798
wait 600
press 150 798
wait 600
press 150 798 --count 10
wait 1500
press 150 798
wait 200
press 150 798
wait 1200
# Interleave to reverse springs mid-flight.
press 252 798
wait 100
press 150 798
wait 100
press 252 798
wait 100
press 252 798
wait 100
press 150 798
wait 1500
# Scroll the list with rows shifted, then restore.
gesture pan 200 600 0 -350 500
wait 1000
gesture pan 200 300 0 350 500
wait 1000
press 150 798 --count 3
wait 1500
wait "text" "Welcome to our community" 3000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 3000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\" id=\"xmark\""
wait 1500
